<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n24705" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδιδράσκω</span></b> , 
			Ion.
		
		<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδιδρήσκω</span></b> , aor. 2
		part.
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δράντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					8.75
				</span></i>
			: pf.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-δέδρᾱκα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Ach.</u>
					601
				</span></i>
			:—<i>run away, escape,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
			</span></i> l. c., <i><span class="en">
				Th.
				7.85
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>PPetr.</u>
				2p.101
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(iii B. C.)</span>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">διαδεδρακότες</span>”
				<i>shirkers,</i>
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
				</span></i>
			 l.c. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> c. acc.,
				<i>escape from,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τινά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					3.135
				</span></i>
			, etc.; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ πάθος, τὸν ὄλεθρον,</span>
			<i><span class="en">
				Aret.
				<u>SA</u>
				1.10
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				2.8
			</span></i>:—
				Pass.
			, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>fly in all directions,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				LXX
				<u>2 Ma.</u>
				8.13
			</span></i>.</div>
